{"seq":14,"slug":"ios-testing-quality","title":"iOS 测试与质量","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality","rating":{"composite":3.62,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# iOS 测试与质量 简介\n\n写出能跑的代码只是开始——让它**持续正确、改动时不退化、出问题能快速定位**，才是工程质量。测试与诊断正是支撑这一点的工程实践。本 hub 面向想把 iOS 应用质量做扎实的工程师，从单元测试基础（XCTest 结构、测试网络与异步代码、依赖注入与测试替身）讲起，覆盖 UI 与集成测试（XCUITest、可测试性与 page object、快照测试）、测试策略与质量（测试金字塔、覆盖率的意义与陷阱、可测试架构），以及调试与诊断（LLDB 调试技巧、Instruments 性能诊断、崩溃与日志）。贯穿全篇的工程要点是：用快而多的单元测试守住逻辑、用依赖注入让代码可测、用合理的测试金字塔分配精力、用覆盖率看缺口而非追数字、用 Instruments 找性能瓶颈、用 symbolication 与统一日志定位线上崩溃。掌握测试与诊断，让你的应用从「能跑」走向「可靠、可维护、可演进」。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"unit-testing-fundamentals","title":"单元测试基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/unit-testing-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"xctest-structure","title":"XCTest 单元测试结构","url":"/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/unit-testing-fundamentals/xctest-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"testing-async-networking","title":"测试异步与网络代码","url":"/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/unit-testing-fundamentals/testing-async-networking"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dependency-injection-test-doubles","title":"依赖注入与测试替身","url":"/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/unit-testing-fundamentals/dependency-injection-test-doubles"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"ui-and-integration-testing","title":"UI 与集成测试","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/ui-and-integration-testing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"xcuitest-basics","title":"XCUITest UI 测试","url":"/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/ui-and-integration-testing/xcuitest-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"testability-page-objects","title":"可测试性与 Page Object","url":"/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/ui-and-integration-testing/testability-page-objects"},{"seq":3,"slug":"snapshot-testing","title":"快照测试","url":"/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/ui-and-integration-testing/sn